nd the router's Mailbox line links `messages/AGENTS.md`; `check` does not validate the entry files. `check` and `close` also fail a ticket whose `skips.md` records a last lane of `lean` or `fix` but has no `## Skipped` entry (format in handoff-format) for a missing planner, per-step verifier, or filer result; a ticket with no `skips.md` lane record (closed before the guard) is exempt. Close citation scan (T-0262): `outside_refs` also greps the ticket root with ignore rules off, so citations under a gitignored `.sdlc/` count; they refuse the close like any other citing file, are rewritten by `--rewrite-refs`, and `--force` prints `left refs to <folder> in <files>` instead of leaving them silent.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"persistedOutputPath":"/Users/kimgranlund/.claude/projects/-Users-kimgranlund-Projects-nonoun-sdlc-lite--claude-worktrees-agent-aaee304bcd5963894/d37f6391-7843-414c-9b5f-3ff80d3a3d36/tool-results/bxavpdc6f.txt","persistedOutputSize":54003}}
