e command string for `claude`, so the repo path failed it.\n+\n+## Context\n+codex-selftest.py `test_fanout_uses_codex`. Cause: a substring check on the command text instead of the argv role or backend.\n+\n+## Constraints\n+The failing test lands with the fix. No push, tag, version bump, or publish. No em dashes.\ndiff --git a/.sdlc/0273-codex-selftest-claude-path/skips.md b/.sdlc/0273-codex-selftest-claude-path/skips.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..c629bab\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.sdlc/0273-codex-selftest-claude-path/skips.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@\n+# Skips\n+\n+## Lane\n+- lane: solo; point: before planning; reasons: size S decides before planning (no planner result yet)\n+\n+## Skipped\n+- skip: planner; step: all; reason: solo lane: runs end to end in one session; decided: lane\n+- skip: filer; step: all; reason: solo lane: runs end to end in one session; decided: lane\ndiff --git a/.sdlc/AGENTS.md b/.sdlc/AGENTS.md\nindex a80bf11..7fd79f2 100644\n--- a/.sdlc/AGENTS.md\n+++ b/.sdlc/AGENTS.md\n@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@\n-<!-- sdlc-lite:managed:start v1 sha256:d3a3b20e46cc -->\n+<!-- sdlc-lite:managed:start v1 sha256:1f7cd8ef64b1 -->\n # Work records\n \n This folder holds SDLC Lite tickets, task records, `roadmap.md`, `notes.md`, and `config`. `tickets.py roadmap` (also run by `new` and `close`) generates this block: do not edit inside it; change a ticket's `handoff.md` front matter and rerun `roadmap`. `roadmap.md` lists every ticket in dependency order. Closed `.NNNN-*` folders are history: open one only when asked.\n@@ -9,7 +9,7 @@ This folder holds SDLC Lite tickets, task records, `roadmap.md`, `notes.md`, and\n \n ## Stages\n \n-- proposed: 20\n+- proposed: 21\n   - T-0233 Gated apply for an approved reorganization plan (dry run, citing-file scan, commit per batch, restore) (0233-reorg-apply)\n   - T-0243 The .sdlc boundary checks B-1a, B-2a, B-3a in docs_check.py (0243-sdlc-boundary-checks)\n   - T-0244 Migrate this repository's docs/ to the schema through the reo