ds cost null, and a `full` fanout lane or a conductor session writes no record. `solo_run.py selftest` runs against a stub `claude` on PATH. Session limit (T-0260): a failed session whose output shows a 429 or a session or usage limit writes `<task dir>/solo.limit` (resume command, evidence) and prints a resume hint on stderr; fanout WIP-commits the marker with the lane, and a later success removes it.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
